      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Once per day as a free action, a sand slave may attempt a @Check[ability:con|dc:20]{Constitution check (DC 20)}. Success indicates that the sand slave has forced its nannites into hyperproductivity, thereby gaining an extra attack or move action each round for 1d8+2 rounds.</p>",
